# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trivy Ignore File (.trivyignore)
# Reference: https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add Misconfiguration IDs (AVD-AWS-xxxx, KSVxxx) or CVE IDs (CVE-yyyy-xxxx)
# with an explanation of why the finding is an accepted architectural risk.
#
# Examples:
# # Public ingress load balancer requires internet-facing HTTP listener:
# AVD-AWS-0053
#
# # Development environment test database non-multi-AZ:
# AVD-AWS-0176
